Code from other projects
------------------------

osu-shelf started as a fork of osu-collect by uwuclxdy
(https://github.com/uwuclxdy/osu-collect). The code it keeps from that project
is used under the MIT licence, and that licence's copyright and permission
notice (LICENSE-MIT) still applies to it.

The osu-downloader folder is a modified copy of uwuclxdy's osu-downloader
library. It stays under MIT OR Apache-2.0 (LICENSE-MIT, LICENSE-APACHE), not
the GPL.

Earlier releases
----------------

osu-shelf 0.1.0 to 0.5.0 were released under MIT OR Apache-2.0, and those
releases stay available under those terms.
